        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: വിനോദസഞ്ചാരി",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിനോദസഞ്ചാരി — vinōdasañcāri — \"a tourist\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മഴക്കാലത്തും ധാരാളം വിനോദസഞ്ചാരികൾ ഇവിടെ വരുന്നു. maḻakkālattuṁ dhārāḷaṁ vinōdasañcārikaḷ iviṭe varunnu. Many tourists come here even in the rainy season."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: വിനോദസഞ്ചാരികൾ, vinōdasañcārikaḷ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally a pleasure traveller: വിനോദം, entertainment, plus സഞ്ചാരി, a traveller."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിനോദസഞ്ചാരി (vinōdasañcāri) is a Malayalam compound built from two Sanskrit words, vinoda, \"pastime, diversion\", and saṁcārin, \"one who moves about\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
